        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man dhanu pa Efraim gicokri karacelo, man gikadhu yor ariwa ma malu; e giwacu ni Yeftha kumae, Nedi ikadhu lokaca nikiedo ku nyithindho mir Amon, ma k’ilwong’owa ngo wacidh kudi? wabiwang’u ot peri i wii ku mac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Yeftha wacu igi kumae, Waku dhanu para wakiedo ngili ngili ku nyithindho mir Amon; man kan alwong’owu, wubodha ngo kud i cing’gi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man kan aneno nia wubodha ngo, akuno kwo para, man akadhu lokaca kum nyithindho mir Amon, man Yehova kethogi i cinga: ka kumeno wuidho malu i bang’a tin nedi, nikiedo kuda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeftha lund ucoko dhanu mi Gilead ceke karacelo, man gikiedo kud Efraim; e dhanu mi Gilead gigoyo Efraim, kum giwacu kumae, Wun wu ju m’upiei ni Efraim, wu Jugileadi, i kind Efraim, man i kind Manase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Jugileadi gimaku kakadhu mi Yordan ni Juefraimi. Man ebedo kumeno, nia, ka jumoko m’upiei ni Efraim giwacu kumae, Wek akadh lokaca, dhanu mi Gilead giwacu ire kumae, In i Jaefraimi? Tek ewacu kumae, Ungo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gilund giwacu ire kumae, Wac Ciboleth; man ewacu Siboleth; kum ecopo ketho lebe wace cu ngo: e gilund gimake, man ginege i kakadhu mi Yordan. Man i nindo maeca dhanu pa Efraim rubanga pier ang’wen wi ario upodho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
